From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:35:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msm8996-common: move LiveDisplay to the AIDL sdm service

vendor.lineage.livedisplay@2.0-service-sdm no longer exists; 24.0 carries
vendor.lineage.livedisplay-service.sdm under
hardware/lineage/interfaces/livedisplay/aidl/sdm. Nothing here set the
livedisplay_sdm soong config, and the module's selects treat an unset value
as the default branch, so display mode and picture adjustment stay enabled
exactly as before.
---
 msm8996.mk | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/msm8996.mk b/msm8996.mk
index 03c8ade3..6009ce7a 100644
--- a/msm8996.mk
+++ b/msm8996.mk
@@ -239,7 +239,7 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
 
 # LiveDisplay
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
-    vendor.lineage.livedisplay@2.0-service-sdm
+    vendor.lineage.livedisplay-service.sdm
 
 # Lineage Health
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
